<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-Sept trade deficit widens to $295.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-Sept trade deficit widens to $295.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's trade deficit widened to $295.6 million in the first nine months of this year from $39.1 million in the same 1995 period, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>KYRGYZ MERCHANDISE TRADE     Jan-Sept 96 Jan-Aug 96 Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    exports ($ million)	   379.4	 306.4	296.8</p>
<p>    imports			   675.1	 540.1	335.9</p>
<p>    trade balance		  -295.6	-233.7	-39.1</p>
<p>(differences due to rounding)</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom +73272 509410</p>
</text>
